Subject: StemWise active-channel admission and history preservation

Clear re-admitted channels from the prior logical requested width, even when
the spectral scheduler still has the old physical width. Preserve Original
history, clear re-admitted pre-roll prefixes, and allocation-free rendering during rapid remove/readmit changes.

